<title>USA: Footstar Inc Q1 sales, net and share rise.</title>
<headline>Footstar Inc Q1 sales, net and share rise.</headline>
<dateline>MAHWAH, N.J. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Oper shr		   $0.16		    $0.03</p>
<p> Oper net		   5,000			900</p>
<p> Sales		    376,900		  336,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     n/a			n/a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: 1996 Q1 is pro forma, adjusted for recognition of incremental overhead costs associated with being a stand-alone public company and elimination of interest income relating to the intercompany balances due to recapitalization of the company.</p>
</text>
